      "message": "For this, there is a condition, that, the local_entity is None, if the public_id is not exist in the cache. So we need to check whether the local_entity is empty here.\n\n\nFor the race condition, as the cache invalidate operation calls the delete of the cache, and the delete is idempotent (can be called multiple times, or on a non-existent key, safely).\nplease refer to: https://github.com/thruflo/dogpile.cache/blob/master/dogpile/cache/region.py#L814\n\n\nSo it safely to invalidate the local_entity even if it\u0027s invalidated before.",
